"P3729600010" "Hellion Interrogation"
// DetailString :
"P3403418182" "The defeated Hellion told you that the Outcasts were interested in buying whatever artifacts the Hellions could come up with, and would give some of the more powerful Hellions relics they could use to manifest powers. This Hellion thought that there was a gang even higher up the chain from the Outcasts who were really pulling the strings though."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2874369006" "I have grave concerns with what the Hellions are up to. They seem to be consorting with the Outcasts on a more regular basis. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Perhaps you should go 'talk' to some of the weaker Hellions</A> and see if they can give anything up on their connection to the Outcasts."
// AcceptString :
"P1361460781" "Find out more about the Hellions' connection to the Outcast by finding a Hellion who will talk"
// SendOffString :
"P1184221378" "If I were you I'd start in Perez Park. Most likely they won't roll over on the Outcasts easily."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1603113405" "Find link between Hellions and Outcasts"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P219578397" "Someone will talk eventually, go defeat some more Hellions"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1060094654" "The last Hellion you defeated told you everything he knew about the connection."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4212523350" "Good job, {HeroName}. I'd be interested in finding out who the Outcasts are reporting to as well, but that will have to wait for another day I think."

